<figure id="S4.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6. </span>Sensitivity to pool density (<math id="S4.T6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\mathcal{S}_{q}^{\cap}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>∩</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\mathcal{S}_{q}^{\cap}|</annotation></semantics></math>, nDCG@5). <span id="S4.T6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">BGE-M3 (Distilled)</span> yields robust gains across all regimes, whereas direct neural rankers fail to outperform baselines.</figcaption>
