<figure id="S4.T8" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8. </span>We contrast top-ranked stories for three queries. <span id="S4.T8.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bold text</span> highlights specific cultural grounding cues. <span id="S4.T8.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EBF5FF;">B-Score (Ours)</span> prioritises narratives where the moral is enacted through specific cultural practices (e.g., <span id="S4.T8.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Rangoli</span>, <span id="S4.T8.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Sharing Bread</span>), whereas the baseline selects generic thematic matches.</figcaption>
<div id="S4.T8.10" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:211.8pt;vertical-align:-103.6pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-12.2pt,7.5pt) scale(0.933866450016594,0.933866450016594) ;">
